Z||000000||ggriner||08-08-2001||03:32 PM||||I have seen pictures of, and mention made, of an 'Indy Scoop' which I assume is an air intake scoop that mounts on the rear deck lid.  Where can I locate one, what actually does it do and  how difficult is it to attach one?||||reg||1
Z||000001||Philphine||08-08-2001||04:08 PM||||orief usually has more info plus is able to do pics, plus i'm not at home right now to have the numbers and addys. but if you do a search for irm (or international research motorsports) or focoa in the general chat section you should get what you need info wise. there's also at least one other place that should show up with what you find there (can't think of it off hand) i have one but i didn't mount it quite as instructed, orief did his more different still. they come with instructions (from irm anyway) so it's not hard to mount it. adapting it to suit a particular purpose will take some extra time.||||reg||1
